            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to Moses, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Say to the people of Israel, The appointed feasts of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " which you shall proclaim as holy convocations, my appointed feasts, are these. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Six days shall work be done; but on the seventh day is a sabbath of solemn rest, a holy convocation; you shall do no work; it is a sabbath to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " in all your dwellings.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“These are the appointed feasts of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", the holy convocations, which you shall proclaim at the time appointed for them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In the first month, on the fourteenth day of the month in the evening,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23.5",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "between the two evenings",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " is the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "'s passover. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And on the fifteenth day of the same month is the feast of unleavened bread to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "; seven days you shall eat unleavened bread. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On the first day you shall have a holy convocation; you shall do no laborious work. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But you shall present an offering by fire to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " seven days; on the seventh day is a holy convocation; you shall do no laborious work.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:8"
          },
